# ============================================================
# To-Do on Steroids — .gitignore
# ============================================================
# ── Node / Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
# ── Vite Build Output ────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
# ── Environment & Secrets ────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: Never commit API keys or secrets.
# This app stores the Gemini API key in the browser's localStorage,
# so no .env file is used — but we ignore any future .env files just in case.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.staging
*.secret
secrets.json
# ── Editor / IDE Configs ─────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.DS_Store